// Changelog

5.27.2k5	First release 0.1.0

2026-10-20	(AIDA) Discourse referents: "theorem x : [?r1:S1, ..., ?rn] P"
		holds the referents ?r in the goal's environment, infers
		their sorts, and refuses "qed" on such a theorem.
2026-10-22	(AIDA) A referent may also be written !r.

